    ]}
  />

  <h2 id="which-to-download">Which Should You Download?</h2>
  <p>If you have limited storage space and are watching on a modern device (a phone or PC made in the last 5 years), downloading the <strong>H.265</strong> version of a video will save you significant space without sacrificing quality.</p>
  <p>However, if you are downloading a video to play on an older Smart TV, a low-end device, or to edit in older software, stick with <strong>H.264</strong> to ensure it plays smoothly without stuttering.</p>
